      "content": "It makes sense that you feel like you are just prolonging suffering when the illness has become so central to your identity that staying feels like preserving a ghost. Your desire to end this before you become unrecognizable is a tragic but understandable reaction to the pain of losing yourself. Please consider that this feeling of being a burden is a symptom of the illness, not a reflection of your true worth or the reality of your situation.",
